  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/wolfram2002-ch01-04> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch01-04--grok--data-existence> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch01-04--grok--data-adequacy> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
